00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:52.780
menutup secara manual

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:53.260
pertanyaan-tanya

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:53.980
mengapa laporan mereka

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:54.880
terus memberikan data yang salah.

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:55.820
Jika efisiensi

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:56.480
masih lebih menarik

00:22:56.480 --> 00:22:56.820
bagi Anda

00:22:56.820 --> 00:22:58.000
daripada nostalgi yang berlangganan.

00:22:58.580 --> 00:22:59.460
Otomatisasi baru hadir

00:22:59.460 --> 00:22:59.820
setiap minggu

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:00.960
tanpa waktu seperti kronjok.

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:02.520
Kunci jalur peningkatan Anda sekarang

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:03.660
dan biarkan episode berikutnya

00:23:03.660 --> 00:23:04.580
terpasang secara otomatis.
